msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ticket payouts & event reports"
msgstr ""

msgid "Refreshes ticket event reports and pays out finished events through Stripe after the configured delay (Vis → Tickets → Event reports). Reports awaiting the Stripe balance are retried on the next run, and the report PDF is emailed to the configured receivers."
msgstr ""

msgid "Automatic payout is disabled. Reports refreshed: %d."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reports refreshed: %1$d. Payouts created: %2$d. Awaiting Stripe balance: %3$d. Errors: %4$d."
msgstr ""

msgid "The report scan is not registered yet. Open Vis → Sync Jobs once to register it."
msgstr ""

msgid "The report scan job is disabled. Enable “Ticket payouts & event reports” under Vis → Sync Jobs."
msgstr ""

msgid "The scan job is enabled and will be scheduled on the next admin request."
msgstr ""

msgid "Stripe mode"
msgstr ""

msgid "Active Stripe mode: Live. Event reports and payouts below cover live payments only."
msgstr ""

msgid "Active Stripe mode: Test. Event reports and payouts below cover test payments only; test payouts move no real money and report emails are not sent."
msgstr ""

msgid "This report belongs to Stripe %1$s mode, but the active mode is %2$s. Switch the mode under Vis → Tickets to pay it out."
msgstr ""

msgid "The site is in Stripe test mode. Report emails are sent only for live-mode reports."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ticket fees"
msgstr ""

msgid "Pass fee to buyers"
msgstr ""

msgid "Add a service fee to every checkout order (tickets, products and renewals)"
msgstr ""

msgid "A single fee per order — never per item — paid by the buyer on top of the stated prices. It applies to all payment methods alike: a payment-specific surcharge would violate the Stripe rules in the EU. When disabled, the organisation covers the Stripe costs itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "Fee basis per order (kr)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Flat amount added to every order. These figures are also used to estimate the Stripe fee in event reports when the exact fees cannot be read from Stripe."
msgstr ""

msgid "Fee percent of order ( % )"
msgstr ""

msgid "Percentage of the order subtotal, rounded up to whole øre, added together with the base amount."
msgstr ""

msgid "Service fee"
msgstr ""

msgid "Service fee (cents)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Event reports (test)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Stripe mode: Live. Stripe actions use the live keys. Event reports show all orders regardless of mode; payouts are made from the live balance."
msgstr ""

msgid "Stripe mode: Test. Stripe actions use test keys only. Event reports and amounts are unaffected; a report containing live payments can only be paid out in Live mode. Report emails follow the cron test setting."
msgstr ""

msgid "This report mixes Stripe test and live payments and cannot be paid out automatically."
msgstr ""

msgid "This report contains %1$s payments, but Vis Tickets is using %2$s Stripe keys. Switch the mode under Vis → Tickets to pay it out."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cron test mode is enabled. Report emails are not sent while testing."
msgstr ""

msgid "Data coverage: %1$d events with confirmed orders, %2$d report rows. Reports are created from orders, not copied from Fjordglimt — if the event count is lower than expected, the ticket-sales import skipped orders (see its plan page: unmatched events / missing ticket types)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Data coverage: %1$d events with confirmed orders, %2$d report rows. Order rows: %3$d (paid %4$d, refunded %5$d, free %6$d). Reports are built from these orders, not copied from Fjordglimt."
msgstr ""

